config SPRD_SIP_SVC
	tristate "Spreadtrum SIP secure monitor service client"
	depends on ARM64
	help
	  Client for the Spreadtrum SIP services implemented by the
	  secure monitor (PERF, STORAGE, PWR, DVFS, NPU, DBG). Consumers
	  such as cpufreq and pdbg call the SMC wrappers through the
	  handle exported by this module.

	  Port of the vendor 5.4 `sprd_sip_svc.ko`.
